{"unit_id":"tag:03YZ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 与 <MATH_0002> 如节 <REF_0001> 中所述。我们已经看到，任意可表（representable）预层（presheaf）都是层（sheaf），在 <MATH_0003> 或 <MATH_0004> 上，见引理 <REF_0002> 和注记 <REF_0003>。以下是一些特殊情形。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03P4:statement","translation":"在任意一个景（sites）<MATH_0001> 或 <MATH_0002> 上，如节 <REF_0001> 所述，\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 层（sheaf）<MATH_0003> 记为 <MATH_0004>，或 <MATH_0005>，或者记为 <MATH_0006>，当我们要指明基概形（base scheme）时。\n<STRUCT_0003> 类似地，层（sheaf）<MATH_0007> 记为 <MATH_0008>，或 <MATH_0009>，或者记为 <MATH_0010>，当我们要指明基概形（base scheme）时。\n<STRUCT_0004> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>常层（constant sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0011>，在任意景（site）上，是层化（sheafification），对于常（constant）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0012>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形"},{"source_term":"constant sheaf","target_term":"常层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"constant sheaf","target_term":"常层","context":"所定义术语，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"常","context":"常预层的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YZ:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n例如，由定理 <REF_0001>，第一个是层（sheaf）。第二个是第一个的子（sub）预层（presheaf），容易看出它本身是层（sheaf）。第三个由定义是层（sheaf）。注意，这些层（sheaves）中的每一个都可表（representable）。第一和第二个由概形（schemes）<MATH_0001> 和 <MATH_0002> 表示，见群胚（Groupoids）节 <REF_0002>。第三个由有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）群概形（group scheme）<MATH_0003> 表示，它有时记为 <MATH_0004>，就是 <MATH_0005> 个 <MATH_0006> 的副本（copies），赋予显然的群概形（group scheme）结构（structure），在 <MATH_0007> 上，见群胚（Groupoids）例 <REF_0003> 及其后的注记。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sub","target_term":"子"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"copies","target_term":"副本"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形"},{"source_term":"structure","target_term":"结构"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sub","target_term":"子","context":"子预层的限定，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"所引章节标题，暂定译法。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"group scheme","target_term":"群概形","context":"暂定译法，待决定。"},{"source_term":"copies","target_term":"副本","con